1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,680
My dad never called
anyone to fix anything.

2
00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:08,070
If it could be done at home,
he did it himself.

3
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:11,080
And I was always one step behind him.

4
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:16,340
Under our old white car,
I held the torch. He held the wrench,

5
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:18,550
and explained every bolt.

6
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:23,410
From a few planks, he built the
rekebot we still serve coffee on.

7
00:00:23,910 --> 00:00:27,520
When the power went out,
everyone said: call someone.

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,840
Dad just picked up his tester.

9
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:31,100
<i>Let's look at it first.</i>

10
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:33,940
And the whole house lit up again.

11
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:42,390
A leaking pipe. A wrench.
Patience. Then… silence.

12
00:00:43,490 --> 00:00:49,410
Years later, he stopped fixing things
for me, and started fixing them with me.

13
00:00:49,450 --> 00:00:52,160
<i>Slowly, slowly,
the egg walks on its own legs.</i>

14
00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:55,990
When I moved out,
he gave me his old toolbox.

15
00:00:56,030 --> 00:01:01,720
Last week, my kitchen tap
started leaking. And I heard him.

16
00:01:01,760 --> 00:01:02,980
<i>Let's look at it first.</i>

17
00:01:03,680 --> 00:01:04,770
So I called him.

18
00:01:04,810 --> 00:01:07,000
Dad, I fixed it myself.

19
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:09,350
<i>Well done, my son.</i>

20
00:01:09,390 --> 00:01:11,670
And I could hear him smiling.

21
00:01:12,670 --> 00:01:15,670
Made with AI
For Dad, who fixes everything himself
